WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.700
Meet your monkey mind. Worry! Scroll! One more thing.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.800
Two minutes. Hold to breathe in. Let go. Your breath becomes a wave that settles the monkeys.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.800
Each monkey is a passing thought. You do not have to follow it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:31.800
One gets through? No game over. One full breath brings you back. That is a return. Returns are the score.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.800
Not perfect focus. Just coming back. Again, and again.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Try Monkey Mind on your phone. A playful practice from The Self-Driving Mind. Scan to play, or explore the book.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.000
By Sundar Rajan.